1
00:00:02,480 --> 00:00:04,648
Water...

2
00:00:04,857 --> 00:00:06,358
Earth...

3
00:00:06,567 --> 00:00:08,694
Fire...

4
00:00:08,903 --> 00:00:10,487
Air.

5
00:00:11,322 --> 00:00:15,367
Long ago, the four nations
lived together in harmony.

6
00:00:15,451 --> 00:00:18,745
Then everything changed
when the Fire Nation attacked.

7
00:00:19,789 --> 00:00:22,499
Only the Avatar,
master of all four elements,

8
00:00:22,583 --> 00:00:23,709
could stop them.

9
00:00:23,793 --> 00:00:25,627
But when the world needed him most,

10
00:00:25,712 --> 00:00:27,004
he vanished.

11
00:00:27,422 --> 00:00:31,216
100 years passed, and my brother
and I discovered the new Avatar,

12
00:00:31,301 --> 00:00:32,884
an airbender named Aang.

13
00:00:32,969 --> 00:00:35,262
And although his
airbending skills are great,

14
00:00:35,346 --> 00:00:37,848
he has a lot to learn
before he's ready to save anyone.

15
00:00:37,932 --> 00:00:38,932
Oof.

16
00:00:39,017 --> 00:00:42,269
But I believe Aang can save the world.

17
00:01:04,208 --> 00:01:06,877
This should give us a good idea
of what's around here.

18
00:01:07,003 --> 00:01:08,045
See if you can find a menu.

19
00:01:08,129 --> 00:01:09,379
I'm starving.

20
00:01:09,464 --> 00:01:11,298
I bet we'll find something
to eat here...

21
00:01:11,382 --> 00:01:13,342
The Fire Days Festival.

22
00:01:13,676 --> 00:01:15,594
Fire Nation cultural exhibits,

23
00:01:15,803 --> 00:01:17,596
jugglers, benders, magicians...

24
00:01:18,264 --> 00:01:21,558
This would be a great place for me
to study some real firebenders.

25
00:01:21,642 --> 00:01:22,976
You might want to rethink that.

26
00:01:23,061 --> 00:01:24,061
Look at this.

27
00:01:24,854 --> 00:01:26,438
Hey, a poster of me!

28
00:01:26,522 --> 00:01:28,023
A wanted poster.

29
00:01:28,358 --> 00:01:29,733
This is bad.

30
00:01:30,693 --> 00:01:31,985
I think we better keep moving.

31
00:01:32,403 --> 00:01:34,112
I have to learn firebending
at some point,

32
00:01:34,322 --> 00:01:37,824
and this could be my only chance
to watch some masters up close.

33
00:01:38,034 --> 00:01:39,618
I guess we could go check it out.

34
00:01:39,952 --> 00:01:41,078
What?

35
00:01:41,162 --> 00:01:42,746
You want to walk into
a Fire Nation town

36
00:01:42,830 --> 00:01:45,749
when they're all fired up
with all their, you know, fire?

37
00:01:45,958 --> 00:01:47,209
We'll wear disguises.

38
00:01:47,293 --> 00:01:48,794
And if it looks like trouble,
we'll leave.

39
00:01:48,878 --> 00:01:50,045
Yeah.

40
00:01:50,129 --> 00:01:52,756
Because we always leave
before we get into trouble.

41
00:02:03,434 --> 00:02:05,936
You guys stay out of sight here
while we go to the festival.

42
00:02:13,694 --> 00:02:15,320
Ready disguises.

43
00:02:23,079 --> 00:02:25,330
It's like you're a whole
different person.

44
00:02:25,415 --> 00:02:26,790
Let's go!

45
00:02:34,715 --> 00:02:36,091
Ha ha ha ha!

46
00:02:42,682 --> 00:02:45,267
I think we need
some new disguises.

47
00:02:45,476 --> 00:02:47,686
Where are we gonna get
masks like that?

48
00:02:47,895 --> 00:02:51,606
Get your genuine
Fire-Festival masks here!

49
00:02:51,691 --> 00:02:53,817
That was surprisingly easy.

50
00:03:03,911 --> 00:03:05,245
Hey, there's some food.

51
00:03:05,329 --> 00:03:06,329
Finally!

52
00:03:06,831 --> 00:03:08,039
What do you have?

53
00:03:08,124 --> 00:03:09,249
Flaming fire flakes.

54
00:03:09,333 --> 00:03:10,375
Best in town.

55
00:03:10,460 --> 00:03:11,460
I'll take 'em.

56
00:03:13,921 --> 00:03:15,297
Hot, hot!

57
00:03:15,381 --> 00:03:18,049
Flaming fire flakes, hot.

58
00:03:18,134 --> 00:03:19,134
What do you know?

59
00:03:19,218 --> 00:03:20,218
Hey, look at this!

60
00:03:22,805 --> 00:03:24,723
Don't worry, loyal citizens,

61
00:03:24,932 --> 00:03:27,976
no one can surprise the Fire Lord!

62
00:03:28,186 --> 00:03:29,811
- No!
- Look out!

63
00:03:36,194 --> 00:03:37,360
Aang, hold on.

64
00:03:37,445 --> 00:03:38,570
Where are we going?

65
00:03:38,654 --> 00:03:39,654
I don't know...

66
00:03:39,739 --> 00:03:41,907
But there's a big crowd,
so it must be good.

67
00:03:41,991 --> 00:03:43,116
Knowing the Fire Nation,

68
00:03:43,201 --> 00:03:44,618
it's probably an execution.

69
00:03:52,710 --> 00:03:54,336
I gotta learn that trick.

70
00:03:54,420 --> 00:03:55,545
Thank you!

71
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:56,671
For my next trick,

72
00:03:56,756 --> 00:03:58,715
I need a volunteer from the audience.

73
00:03:58,799 --> 00:04:00,217
Ooh, ooh! Me! me!

74
00:04:00,301 --> 00:04:01,801
What do you think you're doing?

75
00:04:01,886 --> 00:04:03,553
I want to get a closer look.

76
00:04:03,638 --> 00:04:06,765
It's better that we don't attract
any attention to ourselves.

77
00:04:06,891 --> 00:04:08,642
How about you, little lady?

78
00:04:09,852 --> 00:04:11,811
Aw, she's shy.

79
00:04:11,896 --> 00:04:14,606
Let's give her some
encouragement, folks.

80
00:04:17,652 --> 00:04:19,569
Aw, that could have been me.

81
00:04:22,448 --> 00:04:26,868
This next trick is called
Taming the Dragon!

82
00:04:26,953 --> 00:04:28,787
You will be my captured princess.

83
00:04:39,715 --> 00:04:41,216
Don't worry, young maiden!

84
00:04:41,551 --> 00:04:44,427
I will tame this fiery beast!

85
00:04:49,725 --> 00:04:51,059
It's too strong!

86
00:04:51,143 --> 00:04:52,143
I can't hold it!

87
00:04:52,603 --> 00:04:53,895
We gotta help her!

88
00:04:53,980 --> 00:04:55,605
No, we don't want to make a scene.

89
00:04:55,690 --> 00:04:58,024
The rope... It's breaking!

90
00:05:08,578 --> 00:05:10,745
Hey, you trying to upstage me, kid?

91
00:05:17,837 --> 00:05:20,130
Hey! That kid's the Avatar!

92
00:05:25,136 --> 00:05:26,678
I think it's time to go.

93
00:05:26,762 --> 00:05:27,804
Follow me!

94
00:05:27,888 --> 00:05:29,014
I can get you out of here!

95
00:05:29,098 --> 00:05:30,098
There they are!

96
00:05:39,609 --> 00:05:40,609
Over there!

97
00:05:43,487 --> 00:05:44,779
I'm calling Appa.

98
00:05:47,783 --> 00:05:49,826
I hope he can really hear
that bison whistle!

99
00:05:49,910 --> 00:05:51,077
This way!

100
00:05:53,080 --> 00:05:54,873
Ok, not this way.

101
00:06:09,847 --> 00:06:11,681
Appa, down here!

102
00:06:32,286 --> 00:06:33,662
Beautiful!

103
00:06:37,625 --> 00:06:39,668
Nice touch setting off the fireworks.

104
00:06:39,752 --> 00:06:41,795
You seem to really know
your explosives.

105
00:06:41,879 --> 00:06:42,879
I'm familiar.

106
00:06:43,297 --> 00:06:44,714
You're a Fire Nation soldier.

107
00:06:44,799 --> 00:06:45,882
Was.

108
00:06:45,966 --> 00:06:47,425
My name's Chey.

109
00:06:50,096 --> 00:06:51,596
I serve a man...

110
00:06:51,681 --> 00:06:52,847
More than a man, really,

111
00:06:52,932 --> 00:06:54,015
he's a myth...

112
00:06:54,100 --> 00:06:56,059
But he's real, a living legend...

113
00:06:56,143 --> 00:06:57,977
Jeong Jeong the Deserter.

114
00:06:58,062 --> 00:07:00,146
He was a Fire Nation general.

115
00:07:00,356 --> 00:07:02,273
Or wait... Was he an admiral?

116
00:07:02,483 --> 00:07:04,401
He was very highly ranked. We get it.

117
00:07:04,568 --> 00:07:06,236
Yeah! Way up there!

118
00:07:06,320 --> 00:07:08,196
But he couldn't take
the madness anymore.

119
00:07:08,280 --> 00:07:11,199
He's the first person ever
to leave the army and live.

120
00:07:11,283 --> 00:07:13,660
I'm the second, but you don't
get to be a legend for that.

121
00:07:13,744 --> 00:07:14,744
It's ok, though.

122
00:07:15,204 --> 00:07:17,288
Jeong Jeong's a firebending genius.

123
00:07:17,498 --> 00:07:18,790
Some say he's mad,

124
00:07:18,874 --> 00:07:20,291
but he's not.

125
00:07:20,376 --> 00:07:21,751
He's enlightened.

126
00:07:21,877 --> 00:07:23,420
You mean there's a firebender out here

127
00:07:23,504 --> 00:07:24,921
who's not with the Fire Lord?

128
00:07:25,005 --> 00:07:26,172
We've gotta go see him!

129
00:07:26,257 --> 00:07:27,257
He can train me!

130
00:07:27,591 --> 00:07:30,009
We're not gonna go find
some crazy firebender.

131
00:07:30,219 --> 00:07:31,803
He's not crazy!

132
00:07:31,887 --> 00:07:33,596
He's a genius!

133
00:07:33,681 --> 00:07:36,182
And he's the perfect person
to train the Avatar.

134
00:07:36,267 --> 00:07:38,518
That's why I followed you
into the festival.

135
00:07:38,602 --> 00:07:39,978
Look, thanks for the help,

136
00:07:40,062 --> 00:07:42,230
but we're leaving for the North Pole
in the morning.

137
00:07:42,314 --> 00:07:46,526
Sokka, this could be my only chance
to meet a firebending master

138
00:07:46,610 --> 00:07:48,945
who would actually be willing
to teach me.

139
00:07:49,029 --> 00:07:50,739
It can't hurt just to talk to him.

140
00:07:50,823 --> 00:07:53,283
That's what you said about
going to the festival!

141
00:07:53,367 --> 00:07:55,368
Why doesn't anyone ever listen to me?

142
00:07:57,371 --> 00:07:58,371
Aagh!

143
00:08:01,459 --> 00:08:03,209
Don't move.

144
00:08:11,427 --> 00:08:13,636
Jeong Jeong told you
not to look for Avatar.

145
00:08:13,721 --> 00:08:15,388
Hold on. You know these guys?

146
00:08:15,556 --> 00:08:16,598
Yeah.

147
00:08:16,682 --> 00:08:17,891
Lin Ye's an old buddy.

148
00:08:18,017 --> 00:08:19,100
Right, Lin Ye?

149
00:08:19,185 --> 00:08:20,602
Shut up. Keep moving.

150
00:08:30,404 --> 00:08:32,781
Go on. He sees you only.

151
00:08:32,948 --> 00:08:34,073
That's ok.

152
00:08:34,158 --> 00:08:35,450
We can chat later.

153
00:08:35,534 --> 00:08:36,910
Is that where Jeong Jeong is?

154
00:08:36,994 --> 00:08:38,578
I need to talk to him right away.

155
00:08:38,662 --> 00:08:40,288
No. You wait there.

156
00:08:40,372 --> 00:08:41,956
Go, now!

157
00:08:42,041 --> 00:08:44,209
Don't worry. Everything will be fine.

158
00:08:44,710 --> 00:08:45,919
He's a great man.

159
00:08:46,003 --> 00:08:47,253
A great man!

160
00:08:52,009 --> 00:08:53,968
So, the Avatar was here

161
00:08:54,053 --> 00:08:55,512
and you let him slip away?

162
00:08:55,763 --> 00:08:56,846
Yes, sir.

163
00:08:56,931 --> 00:08:59,390
But other than that,
the festival went off without a hitch.

164
00:09:00,893 --> 00:09:02,811
No fights. Theft was way down.

165
00:09:03,187 --> 00:09:05,647
I don't care
about your local crime rates!

166
00:09:05,731 --> 00:09:07,398
Which way did they go?

167
00:09:07,733 --> 00:09:09,067
They headed into the forest.

168
00:09:09,276 --> 00:09:10,568
Up the river, I suspect.

169
00:09:10,736 --> 00:09:12,654
Ready the riverboats.

170
00:09:12,738 --> 00:09:14,823
We're going after the Avatar.

171
00:09:23,541 --> 00:09:26,125
What happened?
Can I see Jeong Jeong now?

172
00:09:26,210 --> 00:09:27,544
He won't see you.

173
00:09:27,628 --> 00:09:29,754
He's very angry
that I brought you here.

174
00:09:29,839 --> 00:09:31,339
He wants you to leave immediately.

175
00:09:31,423 --> 00:09:33,258
Finally! Let's hit the road.

176
00:09:33,342 --> 00:09:34,801
Why won't he see me?

177
00:09:35,386 --> 00:09:36,761
He says you're not ready.

178
00:09:36,846 --> 00:09:39,597
Says you haven't mastered
waterbending and earthbending yet.

179
00:09:39,682 --> 00:09:41,349
Wait, how does he know that?

180
00:09:41,642 --> 00:09:43,685
He saw the way you walked into camp.

181
00:09:43,769 --> 00:09:45,019
He can tell.

182
00:09:45,104 --> 00:09:46,312
I'm going in anyway.

183
00:09:56,282 --> 00:09:57,782
Get out!

184
00:10:00,744 --> 00:10:03,496
Master, I need to learn firebending.

185
00:10:03,581 --> 00:10:07,500
Only a fool seeks his own destruction.

186
00:10:07,835 --> 00:10:09,294
I am the Avatar.

187
00:10:09,378 --> 00:10:11,045
-It's my destiny to...
-Destiny?

188
00:10:11,130 --> 00:10:13,381
What would a boy know of destiny?

189
00:10:13,465 --> 00:10:16,134
If a fish lives its whole life
in this river,

190
00:10:16,218 --> 00:10:17,969
does he know the river's destiny?

191
00:10:18,053 --> 00:10:19,220
No!

192
00:10:19,305 --> 00:10:22,307
Only that it runs on and on
out of his control.

193
00:10:22,391 --> 00:10:24,017
He may follow where it flows,

194
00:10:24,101 --> 00:10:26,394
but he cannot see the end.

195
00:10:26,478 --> 00:10:28,771
He cannot imagine the ocean.

196
00:10:29,440 --> 00:10:31,107
Ok...

197
00:10:31,191 --> 00:10:32,567
But it's the Avatar's duty

198
00:10:32,651 --> 00:10:34,903
to master all of
the bending disciplines.

199
00:10:34,987 --> 00:10:37,155
To master the bending disciplines,

200
00:10:37,239 --> 00:10:40,074
you must first master
discipline itself.

201
00:10:40,326 --> 00:10:41,910
But you have no interest in this,

202
00:10:41,994 --> 00:10:43,536
so I have no interest in you.

203
00:10:43,621 --> 00:10:45,663
Now, get out.

204
00:10:45,748 --> 00:10:48,291
Please, I have to learn.

205
00:10:48,375 --> 00:10:49,959
This could be my only chance.

206
00:10:50,377 --> 00:10:51,586
Are you deaf?

207
00:10:51,670 --> 00:10:55,048
How can I teach you
if you refuse to listen?

208
00:10:55,132 --> 00:10:56,883
Before learning firebending,

209
00:10:56,967 --> 00:10:59,052
you must learn water and earth.

210
00:10:59,136 --> 00:11:01,179
Water is cool and soothing.

211
00:11:01,263 --> 00:11:03,181
Earth is steady and stable.

212
00:11:03,390 --> 00:11:04,599
But fire...

213
00:11:04,683 --> 00:11:06,392
Fire is alive.

214
00:11:06,477 --> 00:11:08,686
It breathes, it grows.

215
00:11:08,771 --> 00:11:11,356
Without the bender,
a rock will not throw itself.

216
00:11:11,565 --> 00:11:12,857
But fire will spread

217
00:11:12,942 --> 00:11:15,068
and destroy everything in its path

218
00:11:15,152 --> 00:11:17,820
if one does not have
the will to control it!

219
00:11:18,322 --> 00:11:19,697
That is its destiny.

220
00:11:19,865 --> 00:11:21,199
You are not ready!

221
00:11:21,283 --> 00:11:23,284
You are too weak!

222
00:11:28,082 --> 00:11:29,540
You think I am weak?

223
00:11:29,625 --> 00:11:31,292
Avatar Roku!

224
00:11:31,377 --> 00:11:32,502
No, no!

225
00:11:32,586 --> 00:11:33,711
I did not mean that.

226
00:11:33,796 --> 00:11:35,338
I have mastered the elements

227
00:11:35,422 --> 00:11:38,633
a thousand times
in a thousand lifetimes.

228
00:11:38,717 --> 00:11:41,427
Now, I must do it once again.

229
00:11:41,637 --> 00:11:46,015
You will teach the Avatar firebending.

230
00:11:46,100 --> 00:11:47,433
Yes, yes.

231
00:11:47,893 --> 00:11:49,727
I will teach you.

232
00:11:49,812 --> 00:11:50,812
Really?

233
00:11:51,063 --> 00:11:52,271
That's great!

234
00:11:59,238 --> 00:12:00,697
Widen your stance.

235
00:12:02,199 --> 00:12:04,033
Wider!

236
00:12:04,118 --> 00:12:05,326
Bend your knees.

237
00:12:05,411 --> 00:12:06,869
Now, concentrate.

238
00:12:07,579 --> 00:12:09,205
Good. Good!

239
00:12:09,289 --> 00:12:10,581
Wait. What do I do now?

240
00:12:11,000 --> 00:12:13,793
Silence! Talking is not concentrating.

241
00:12:13,877 --> 00:12:15,920
Look at your friend. Is she talking?

242
00:12:16,005 --> 00:12:18,339
Even that oaf knows to concentrate
on what he's doing.

243
00:12:18,424 --> 00:12:19,424
Hey!

244
00:12:19,758 --> 00:12:21,718
But what am I concentrating on?

245
00:12:21,802 --> 00:12:24,303
Feel the heat of the sun.

246
00:12:24,388 --> 00:12:26,597
It is the greatest source of fire,

247
00:12:26,682 --> 00:12:29,308
yet it is in complete balance
with nature.

248
00:12:29,518 --> 00:12:31,019
So, when do I get to make some fire?

249
00:12:31,103 --> 00:12:32,937
Concentrate!

250
00:12:44,074 --> 00:12:45,616
Are we coming up here
so I don't burn anything

251
00:12:45,701 --> 00:12:46,701
with my fire blasts?

252
00:12:46,952 --> 00:12:48,369
No fire yet.

253
00:12:48,454 --> 00:12:49,537
What?

254
00:12:50,539 --> 00:12:53,291
Power in firebending
comes from the breath.

255
00:12:53,375 --> 00:12:56,044
That is why you must master
proper breath control.

256
00:12:56,879 --> 00:12:58,713
You brought me up here to breathe?

257
00:12:58,797 --> 00:13:00,298
Assume your stance.

258
00:13:00,382 --> 00:13:01,424
Wider.

259
00:13:01,508 --> 00:13:02,717
-You're not even look...
-Wider!

260
00:13:02,801 --> 00:13:06,054
Now, inhale through the nose
and exhale through the mouth...

261
00:13:06,138 --> 00:13:07,138
Without talking.

262
00:13:11,643 --> 00:13:13,478
Good. Keep going.

263
00:13:23,989 --> 00:13:25,281
What are you doing here?

264
00:13:25,365 --> 00:13:26,908
I did not tell you to stop!

265
00:13:26,992 --> 00:13:28,576
I've been breathing for hours.

266
00:13:28,911 --> 00:13:30,703
You want to stop breathing?

267
00:13:30,913 --> 00:13:33,206
I want you to stop wasting my time.

268
00:13:33,290 --> 00:13:35,124
I already know
how to squat and breathe

269
00:13:35,209 --> 00:13:36,292
and feel the sun.

270
00:13:36,376 --> 00:13:39,253
I want to know how to shoot fire
out of my fingertips.

271
00:13:41,215 --> 00:13:43,049
I had a pupil once

272
00:13:43,133 --> 00:13:46,302
who had no interest
in learning discipline.

273
00:13:46,386 --> 00:13:49,263
He was only concerned
with the power of fire...

274
00:13:49,348 --> 00:13:51,557
How he could use it
to destroy his opponents

275
00:13:51,642 --> 00:13:54,894
and wipe out the obstacles
in his path,

276
00:13:54,978 --> 00:13:57,897
but fire is a horrible burden to bear.

277
00:13:58,232 --> 00:13:59,941
Its nature is to consume,

278
00:14:00,025 --> 00:14:03,945
and without control,
it destroys everything around it.

279
00:14:16,375 --> 00:14:17,792
Learn restraint,

280
00:14:17,876 --> 00:14:21,420
or risk destroying yourself
and everything you love.

281
00:14:31,181 --> 00:14:32,849
I thought about what you said.

282
00:14:32,933 --> 00:14:34,600
I promise I'll be more patient.

283
00:14:35,102 --> 00:14:37,979
We're going to work with fire now.

284
00:14:38,063 --> 00:14:39,188
Yeah!

285
00:14:41,441 --> 00:14:42,483
I mean...

286
00:14:42,568 --> 00:14:43,568
Let us begin.

287
00:14:46,697 --> 00:14:48,906
Concentrate on the fire.

288
00:14:49,283 --> 00:14:51,951
I want you to keep this flame
from reaching the edges of the leaf

289
00:14:52,035 --> 00:14:54,078
for as long as you can.

290
00:14:55,497 --> 00:14:57,373
Master, there is trouble!

291
00:14:57,457 --> 00:14:58,833
What's going on?!

292
00:14:58,917 --> 00:15:00,376
Concentrate on your leaf.

293
00:15:00,460 --> 00:15:02,879
This is the worst
firebending instruction ever.

294
00:15:02,963 --> 00:15:05,006
All he does
is leave me alone for hours

295
00:15:05,090 --> 00:15:06,757
to concentrate or breathe.

296
00:15:06,842 --> 00:15:08,634
I'm sure there's a good reason.

297
00:15:08,844 --> 00:15:11,012
But I'm ready to do so much more.

298
00:15:24,735 --> 00:15:26,736
I did it. I made fire!

299
00:15:27,946 --> 00:15:29,071
Aang, that's great.

300
00:15:29,156 --> 00:15:30,698
But you should take it slow.

301
00:15:30,782 --> 00:15:32,158
-Whoa!
-Careful!

302
00:15:32,326 --> 00:15:33,743
Aagh!

303
00:15:33,827 --> 00:15:35,536
Now, that's firebending.

304
00:15:37,789 --> 00:15:39,373
Aang, you'll hurt yourself.

305
00:15:44,796 --> 00:15:46,297
I wonder how that juggler did it.

306
00:15:52,679 --> 00:15:53,971
Katara!

307
00:15:54,056 --> 00:15:55,473
I'm so sorry!

308
00:15:56,892 --> 00:15:58,476
Katara, what's wrong?

309
00:15:58,685 --> 00:15:59,977
What did you do?

310
00:16:00,145 --> 00:16:01,562
It was an accident!

311
00:16:01,647 --> 00:16:03,314
I was... Katara, I'm so...

312
00:16:04,483 --> 00:16:06,150
I told you we shouldn't
mess around with this!

313
00:16:06,235 --> 00:16:07,318
Look what you did!

314
00:16:07,444 --> 00:16:09,320
You burned my sister!

315
00:16:23,961 --> 00:16:26,087
You burned my sister!

316
00:16:26,296 --> 00:16:28,005
This is all your fault!

317
00:16:28,215 --> 00:16:29,840
I know! Now, pack your things.

318
00:16:29,925 --> 00:16:31,592
You must leave immediately.

319
00:16:32,344 --> 00:16:33,761
I'm sorry.

320
00:16:33,845 --> 00:16:35,137
I didn't...

321
00:16:35,222 --> 00:16:36,555
I'm sorry!

322
00:17:06,211 --> 00:17:08,212
You have healing abilities.

323
00:17:09,047 --> 00:17:12,967
The great benders of the Water Tribes
sometimes have this ability.

324
00:17:13,051 --> 00:17:16,012
I've always wished
I were blessed like you...

325
00:17:16,096 --> 00:17:18,681
Free from this burning curse.

326
00:17:18,765 --> 00:17:20,641
But you're a great master.

327
00:17:20,726 --> 00:17:22,476
You have powers I'll never know.

328
00:17:22,561 --> 00:17:25,688
Water brings healing and life.

329
00:17:25,772 --> 00:17:29,025
But fire brings only destruction
and pain.

330
00:17:29,109 --> 00:17:31,569
It forces those of us
burdened with its care

331
00:17:31,653 --> 00:17:36,032
to walk a razor's edge
between humanity and savagery.

332
00:17:36,199 --> 00:17:39,327
Eventually we're torn apart.

333
00:17:46,168 --> 00:17:48,461
Go get your friends and flee!

334
00:17:48,754 --> 00:17:51,422
Do not come back here
or you will all be destroyed!

335
00:17:51,506 --> 00:17:52,757
Hurry!

336
00:18:11,109 --> 00:18:12,610
Don't worry, men.

337
00:18:12,694 --> 00:18:15,780
My old teacher gave up fighting
a long time ago...

338
00:18:17,366 --> 00:18:19,367
Haven't you, Master Jeong Jeong?

339
00:18:26,375 --> 00:18:28,084
Katara, are you all right?

340
00:18:28,168 --> 00:18:29,377
I'm fine.

341
00:18:29,461 --> 00:18:30,669
We've gotta get out of here.

342
00:18:30,754 --> 00:18:31,921
Where's Aang?

343
00:18:39,554 --> 00:18:42,181
Jeong Jeong tried to tell me
that I wasn't ready.

344
00:18:42,265 --> 00:18:43,808
I wouldn't listen.

345
00:18:43,892 --> 00:18:45,768
I'm never gonna firebend again.

346
00:18:45,852 --> 00:18:47,436
You'll have to eventually.

347
00:18:47,687 --> 00:18:49,688
No, never again.

348
00:18:49,773 --> 00:18:51,941
It's ok, Aang. I'm healed.

349
00:18:52,025 --> 00:18:53,651
What? How?

350
00:18:53,735 --> 00:18:55,194
I'll explain later.

351
00:18:55,278 --> 00:18:56,987
But, right now,
we have to get out of here.

352
00:18:57,155 --> 00:18:59,240
Zhao and his soldiers are attacking.

353
00:18:59,324 --> 00:19:00,366
Where?

354
00:19:00,575 --> 00:19:01,700
By the river.

355
00:19:01,785 --> 00:19:03,285
They captured Jeong Jeong.

356
00:19:03,370 --> 00:19:04,995
I have to help him!

357
00:19:05,831 --> 00:19:06,914
Look at you.

358
00:19:06,998 --> 00:19:10,167
You were once so great.

359
00:19:10,252 --> 00:19:12,294
I can't believe my former master

360
00:19:12,379 --> 00:19:15,089
has become nothing more
than a simple savage.

361
00:19:15,173 --> 00:19:17,883
It is you who have embraced
savagery, Zhao.

362
00:19:17,968 --> 00:19:20,511
It's Admiral Zhao now.

363
00:19:20,595 --> 00:19:23,556
That title will not help you
against the Avatar.

364
00:19:23,640 --> 00:19:25,015
Do not try to fight him.

365
00:19:25,100 --> 00:19:26,767
You are no match.

366
00:19:26,852 --> 00:19:29,061
I think I can handle a child.

367
00:19:29,146 --> 00:19:33,023
I have never seen such raw power.

368
00:19:34,276 --> 00:19:35,359
Jeong Jeong!

369
00:19:35,444 --> 00:19:36,527
We'll see.

370
00:19:36,611 --> 00:19:38,279
Men, take The Deserter.

371
00:19:46,538 --> 00:19:47,746
It's a trick!

372
00:19:47,831 --> 00:19:49,081
He's run off into the woods.

373
00:19:49,166 --> 00:19:50,666
Find him!

374
00:19:51,877 --> 00:19:55,212
Let's find out what my old master
has taught you.

375
00:19:55,297 --> 00:19:57,047
You were Jeong Jeong's student?

376
00:19:57,132 --> 00:19:59,008
Until I got bored.

377
00:20:03,847 --> 00:20:06,682
I see he taught you
how to duck and run like a coward,

378
00:20:06,766 --> 00:20:10,686
but I doubt he showed you
what a firebender is truly capable of!

379
00:20:14,357 --> 00:20:15,774
Whoa! Wild shot!

380
00:20:15,859 --> 00:20:17,735
I'll show you wild!

381
00:20:24,993 --> 00:20:26,494
No self-control.

382
00:20:28,914 --> 00:20:30,706
Stand and fight, Avatar!

383
00:20:30,790 --> 00:20:32,249
Were we fighting?

384
00:20:32,334 --> 00:20:34,126
I thought you were
just getting warmed up.

385
00:20:34,211 --> 00:20:35,336
I was.

386
00:20:37,881 --> 00:20:39,215
Is that all you got?

387
00:20:39,299 --> 00:20:41,800
Man, they'll make anyone
an admiral these days.

388
00:20:47,891 --> 00:20:49,099
Ahoy!

389
00:20:49,184 --> 00:20:50,809
I'm Admiral Zhao.

390
00:20:58,985 --> 00:21:02,446
I don't know why, but I thought
you'd be better than Zuko.

391
00:21:02,614 --> 00:21:03,697
Aagh!

392
00:21:05,992 --> 00:21:07,201
Sloppy.

393
00:21:07,285 --> 00:21:09,119
Very sloppy.

394
00:21:21,383 --> 00:21:22,424
Nowhere to run now,

395
00:21:22,509 --> 00:21:24,301
you little smart mouth.

396
00:21:27,764 --> 00:21:29,348
You've lost this battle.

397
00:21:31,518 --> 00:21:32,518
Are you crazy?

398
00:21:32,852 --> 00:21:34,353
You haven't thrown a single blow.

399
00:21:34,521 --> 00:21:36,480
No, but you have.

400
00:21:42,696 --> 00:21:44,655
Jeong Jeong said you had no restraint.

401
00:21:53,999 --> 00:21:56,041
Have a nice walk home!

402
00:21:56,126 --> 00:21:57,418
Aang, come on!

403
00:21:57,502 --> 00:21:58,711
Let's go!

404
00:22:01,756 --> 00:22:03,215
Wait! Where's Jeong Jeong?

405
00:22:03,300 --> 00:22:04,883
He disappeared.

406
00:22:04,968 --> 00:22:06,176
They all did.

407
00:22:14,019 --> 00:22:15,728
Hey, where'd everybody go?

408
00:22:16,855 --> 00:22:18,230
Very funny, guys!

409
00:22:27,574 --> 00:22:29,241
Aang, you're burned.

410
00:22:31,745 --> 00:22:32,745
Let me help you.

411
00:22:45,508 --> 00:22:47,051
Wow! That's good water.

412
00:22:47,260 --> 00:22:49,261
When did you learn how to do that?

413
00:22:49,346 --> 00:22:50,554
I guess I always knew.

414
00:22:51,222 --> 00:22:52,389
Well, then,

415
00:22:52,474 --> 00:22:54,183
thanks for all the first aid
over the years...

416
00:22:54,267 --> 00:22:56,226
Like, when I fell into
the greaseberry bramble,

417
00:22:56,311 --> 00:22:59,188
and that time I had two fishhooks
in my thumb!

418
00:22:59,272 --> 00:23:00,481
Two?

419
00:23:00,565 --> 00:23:03,442
He tried to get the first fishhook out
with another fishhook.

420
00:23:03,526 --> 00:23:06,153
And the time
that mink snake bit me.

421
00:23:06,237 --> 00:23:07,780
Thanks for healing that up.

422
00:23:07,864 --> 00:23:09,823
That's great. Really helpful.
